      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Character image -> 8-direction pixel sprites, with FLUX 3 Image Klein\n\n1. Load a character image (blue), ideally full body on a plain background (= <ref_image_0>).\n2. \"View prompts\" (green): ONE TURN INSTRUCTION PER VIEW, in the order of \"names\" on the Save node:\n   front, front-right, right, back-right, back\n   The prompt upsampler turns each line into the full caption Klein wants.\n3. Klein draws each view (16 steps, cfg 1).\n4. All views are pixelized together: body 64 art px tall, feet on the bottom line, one shared palette.\n5. Save directions: left-side views are the mirrored right-side ones -> 8 directions.\nSaved to output/pixel/: directions_klein_*_<direction>.png, sheet, .json; raw views in pixel/directions_klein_raw_*.png.\nLicence: FLUX Kommunity v1.0 - commercial use of outputs only under US$5M revenue, with content review."
      ],
      "title": "READ ME"
